Package: xxc-cleaners
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Depends: libc6
Recommends: systemd
Suggests: docker.io, apache2
Description: XXC The Cleaners - retention & cleanup tool for Linux
 When things get messy, you call in The Cleaners.
 .
 A fast, safe retention and cleanup utility for Linux servers and
 workstations. It discovers and reclaims space from user/root caches,
 /tmp, the APT cache, rotated and compressed system logs, Apache logs,
 pip/npm/yarn/pnpm and Go build caches, browser caches, old AI assistant
 caches, core dumps, the systemd journal and Docker build cache.
 .
 Supports dry-run previews, silent/verbose modes, per-area retention,
 whitelist path protection, a visual TUI (--interactive) with search,
 filtering and a disk-usage overview, and fully autonomous operation
 from crontab.
